                        </div>
                        <div class="step-connector"></div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="process-step scroll-animate">
                        <div class="step-header">
                            <div class="step-number">04</div>
                            <div class="step-icon">
                                <i class="fas fa-tools"></i>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="step-content">
                            <h3>Execution</h3>
                            <p>Professional execution with skilled craftsmen, regular quality checks and real-time progress updates.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="step-connector"></div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="process-step scroll-animate">
                        <div class="step-header">
                            <div class="step-number">05</div>
                            <div class="step-icon">
                                <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="step-content">
                            <h3>Quality Check</h3>
                            <p>Thorough quality inspection, final touches, and comprehensive testing to ensure absolute perfection.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="step-connector"></div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="process-step scroll-animate">
                        <div class="step-header">
                            <div class="step-number">06</div>
                            <div class="step-icon">
